Protocol routing approach informed by fangkampanat/gmaps-patches (GPL-3.0); its upstream NOTICE is retained in UPSTREAM-NOTICE.
BYD DiLink 3 projection protocol and DiLink 5.1 cluster-theme research informed by shihabal3amri/DiPlay (GPL-3.0); fixed shell commands, firmware profiles and recovery remain firmware-specific and experimental.
This bundle contains only owned Maps/Google-app patches and runtime code plus corresponding source and notices. No Google application implementation classes, APKs, signing keys, tokens or account data are bundled. Original applications and Gemini are obtained separately by the user.
This is an experimental TEST preview, not a stable application release. EV route integration remains BEV-only; PHEV/HEV profiles describe the powertrain but this bridge supplies no fuel or combined energy model.
The car icon on the map (assets/vehicle-icon/) is an own top-down rendering of "suv-luxury" from Kenney Car Kit 3.1 (www.kenney.nl), CC0 1.0; it replaces only the image of Google's location arrow at patch time, and no Google bytes are bundled.
